                <h1 class="h2 fw-bold mb-2">1.2 Monolithic vs Layered vs Distributed Systems</h1>
                <p class="mb-2 mb-lg-0">Learn the practical difference, when to choose each style, and how teams typically evolve architecture safely.</p>
